  "reviewNotes": [
    "Do not infer or display a fixed marketing count such as 36/38 from the number of rows: the legal text groups several molecular disorders under shared ICD-10 headings.",
    "The 2025 Ministry news still commonly describes the program as 36 diseases, but the legal amendment effective 2026-04-01 adds AADC deficiency and X-linked adrenoleukodystrophy; MiniMed should key identity to the legal edition rather than a stale count label.",
    "Screen-positive or high-risk status is not a diagnosis; confirmatory testing and medical-genetic counseling are separate workflow steps.",
    "This artifact intentionally stores semantic concept IDs rather than reproducing full statutory wording.",
    "A second line-by-line legal review is required before this dataset can leave research status."
